who has just been admitted to the general ward
and is making trouble by arguing with the
nursing staff. When you step into her room and
she sees you, she says seductively: ‘Oh, my
lovely doctor. | am sure you are a gentleman
and understand my needs. | want a private
room with classy and beautiful furniture. | can''t
eat hospital foods because they are rubbish. |
need to order French dishes as they are my
favourite. | need access to my makeup artist
and want my little dog here for comfort. | am
sure you are brilliant and Know what | am talking
about. You are the one who understands me.
These idiot nurses don''t’. Which of the following
conditions is most likely present in this woman?','{"A":"Narcissistic personality disorder.","B":"Histrionic personality disorder.","C":"Schizophrenia.","D":"Hallucinations.","E":"Schizotypal personality disorder."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-f4d46dec3564","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"03c3f4ab62fc6e53a4e4","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_page":135,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"03c3f4ab62fc6e53a4e4","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":135,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Mental Health","stem":"A nurse calls you to see a 33-year-old woman\nwho has just been admitted to the general ward\nand is making trouble by arguing with the\nnursing staff. When you step into her room and\nshe sees you, she says seductively: ‘Oh, my\nlovely doctor. | am sure you are a gentleman\nand understand my needs. | want a private\nroom with classy and beautiful furniture. | can''t\neat hospital foods because they are rubbish. |\nneed to order French dishes as they are my\nfavourite. | need access to my makeup artist\nand want my little dog here for comfort. | am\nsure you are brilliant and Know what | am talking\nabout. You are the one who understands me.\nThese idiot nurses don''t’. Which of the following\nconditions is most likely present in this woman?","options":{"A":"Narcissistic personality disorder.","B":"Histrionic personality disorder.","C":"Schizophrenia.","D":"