debt due to a recent severe drought. He is
planning to commit suicide so that his family
can use his life insurance. He feels anxious and
irritable but does not show symptoms of
depressive disorders. You know him well and
consulted him for alcohol use and problem
gambling and know, from his wife, that he is
reckless around money, spends a lot in pubs
and casinos, and has problem drinking issues.
He blames the government and authorities for
what he is going through and believes that if
they had been more responsible and done their
jobs right, he would not be like this. Which one
of the following defence mechanisms is he
using?','{"A":"Denial.","B":"Projection.","C":"Displacement.","D":"Rationalisation.","E":"Regression."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[171],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-3107233d9945","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"928bc6c56ffded2f760e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_page":171,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"34fc5540964154670e0d","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Psychiatry  Amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Psychiatry  Amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":33,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"928bc6c56ffded2f760e","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Psychiatry  (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":171,"supporting_pages":[171],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Mental Health","stem":"A 50-year-old farmer is in significant financial\ndebt due to a recent severe drought. He is\nplanning to commit suicide so that his family\ncan use his life insurance. He feels anxious and\nirritable but does not show symptoms of\ndepressive disorders. You know him well and\nconsulted him for alcohol use and problem\ngambling and know, from his wife, that he is\nreckless around money, spends a lot in pubs\nand casinos, and has problem drinking issues.\nHe blames the government and authorities for\nwhat he is going through and believes that if\nthey had been more responsible and done their\njobs right, he would not be like this. Which one\nof the following defence mechanisms is he\nusing?","options":{"A":"Deni