consultation. The man is concerned about
her wife because she has been progressively
edgy at home for the past eight months. She
is always fighting with their 8-year-old
daughter as to why she is not doing her
homework and is extremely anxious and
distressed about her health. She worries a lot
about financial issues and is concerned about
not having money for the future despite the
