12 and lived on the streets, where she started
using alcohol and marijuana. Her criminal
records show multiple arrests for shoplifting
and prostitution. During the interview, she is
calm and communicative. When you ask if
she has ever considered going back home,
she answers | have nothing to do at home,
and lam not going back there. Which of the
following is the most likely underlying cause
