presents to your practice for consultation.
She is concerned about his husband because
he has recently behaved childishly and
bizarrely. Last week, he was dismissed from
his job as a manager in a local restaurant
because he was rude to customers and
shouted at his colleagues. He does not shave,
bathe or change his clothes as before and is
always dishevelled and unkempt. She denies
any falls, gait abnormalities, or hallucinations
in her husband. His memory is not
